    other than the battling monster; your battling monster gains DEF equal to that
    monster''s DEF, during that damage calculation only. When an opponent''s monster
    declares a direct attack: You can banish this card from your GY, then target
    1 "Superheavy Samurai" monster in your GY; Special Summon it.'
